# Two-Pass Review compatibility command

`/two-pass-review` is the deprecated name for `/review-panel`.

## Run the canonical workflow

1. Preserve the caller's artifact, mode, options, goal or intent, and all other arguments.
2. Read `../review-panel/SKILL.md`, resolved relative to this skill directory.
3. Follow that workflow immediately with the preserved inputs.

Do not ask the caller to repeat the request with the new command. Do not run a second review after
the canonical workflow finishes.
